//HELLO    JOB (001),'HELLO WORLD',CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=A,MSGLEVEL=(1,1)
//COMPILE  EXEC COBUC
//COB.SYSIN DD *
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. HELLO.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY 'HELLO WORLD FROM MVS 3.8J TK4-!'.
           DISPLAY 'THIS JOB WAS SUBMITTED AND COMPILED SUCCESSFULLY.'.
           DISPLAY 'CURRENT DATE: ' FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE.
           STOP RUN.
